    <briefdescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classAIAgent" kindref="compound">AIAgent</ref> interface describes the behavior of any implemented Artificial Intelligence agent. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This abstract base class inherits from <ref refid="classPlayer" kindref="compound">Player</ref> and establishes a common interface for all AI agents (such as <ref refid="classMiniMaxAgent" kindref="compound">MiniMaxAgent</ref>). It defines the basic functions necessary for an agent to reset its internal state before a new turn or game.</para>
    </detaileddescription>
